{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1000_null", "source_sha256": "70eb6ba0894e0dd112b8d70989218817dd42eb5223dba3a46f054de390513b42", "ja": "＜テキスト非表示＞", "zh": "＜不显示文本＞", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "a984b40130bcd9f26aa8b5cf42e64a5bdd8c69138f0cf1143be3a0f844571af2", "ja": "■「ここまでのあらすじ」画面内表示■", "zh": "■“前情提要”画面内显示■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "47128062720ba892a93d4341b84ce4fa431f5253179d77f96cdfbadb701d2f4e", "ja": "『765プロライブ劇場　プレオープンステージ』\n開催から数日後……", "zh": "“765职业现场剧场　预开放舞台”\n举办数日后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "e47a9d23def4d47bae8f2eb3f2417c087862a67a3abefe646dd3589b3dbbb222", "ja": "みんな集まったみたいだな……。\nこほん、それじゃあミーティングを始めよう。", "zh": "大家好像都到齐了啊……\n咳咳，那么我们就开始开会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "49bb217da878292c681ccd2311c6b2e1d5644de3e111e9e9c1ffddb6fd23c4eb", "ja": "あらためて、Team1stのみんな！\nプレオープンステージ、お疲れさま！", "zh": "再次向Team1st的各位说一声！\n试营业演出，大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "de76005c36934bcbcaa07592dce6295bf6c39baccd147d50337640fa7c4bf262", "ja": "お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "大家辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "f8a4ffe78e51b1467ecce0ccc5f9f0f1085f51cc96295f7fbed0c489cbaf8586", "ja": "お疲れさまでした～♪", "zh": "辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "7b4cbdcd7ae7d6ec677cb963e6e8b9dfc84c12b42da7dc009f6c1e988451cac9", "ja": "お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "c2a0b19ec1446c34b524f420d097f2d294f15c9664d1916a5a567a3978099b39", "ja": "お疲れ、さま……。", "zh": "辛苦，了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "6c3d492b2b3d2ea2e77ea83a3d2eaa852c9481f554c805054b8652aa2e8b34d7", "ja": "本番まで毎日ず～っとドキドキしてましたけど、\nステージに出たら、あっという間でした♪", "zh": "虽然直到正式演出前每天都一直紧张得心怦怦跳，但一上台，转眼间就结束了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9dca4065d99f8e4ecb7610eacd485f5b21751014ce6468c4990d938c37a79d5", "ja": "杏奈……緊張で、よく覚えてない……。", "zh": "杏奈……紧张得都不太记得了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "72780a7f7b653ad8a505b57226b6a46f888c52037978290b9e04c1760783d721", "ja": "ひとまず合格点のステージでしたね～。\nでも、本番はこれからですよ～。", "zh": "总之，这次的舞台算是及格了呢～  \n不过，真正的挑战才刚刚开始哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "bbc8b12eb21e828cdbfd59d886dd5cd9e48b73a68f17175d0e25b13078e51b16", "ja": "そうですね。デビューして終わりじゃ困りますし。\nTeam1stらしく、先頭を走り続けないと。", "zh": "没错。要是出道就结束的话可不行。作为Team1st，必须继续跑在最前面才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8e6a338ee53fa4f11d675156f1304f65f4b97e972a37334d865f43f43d1d53c", "ja": "はい♪　先を照らし続けてこその聖母であり、\nTeam1stですから～。", "zh": "是的♪毕竟，持续照亮前路，才是圣母，也才是Team1st嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "5f09ae70cd14194194966cbd05f558f3e0d40f1b4e0cb080e14085fb0d9f85a6", "ja": "もう、自分達でハードル上げるんだから。\nでも、そうだね。これからも一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "真是的，你们又自己把门槛抬高。\n不过，说得也是呢。今后也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "1e49a0fadd1d7820f4e4770aae8bd3e8ad60a7a64ea1648b1410dddf24d14027", "ja": "……ん……。", "zh": "……嗯……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "6f5fb4f656a6934ff1a73f4157a1243395b67cb13ef54c7b504d270329b3775a", "ja": "うん、その意気だ！　というわけで、今日は\nこのチームでの、次の仕事の話なんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，就是这个劲头！那么，今天要说的是\n这个团队接下来的工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "0a32e0813cb03e7264cb2289dd762184bc1b729dd458f966d740428a873d96ec", "ja": "じつは、インストアライブと、\n特典サイン＆握手会の開催が決まった！", "zh": "其实，店内演唱会以及特典签名会和握手会都已经确定要举办了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "55b55548c8f54a0eb38707a49cb961d3b8b9352a942000dadfbbe67d0bc0c640", "ja": "わぁ～、ありがとうございます♪　なんだか、\nアイドルっぽいお仕事が盛りだくさんですね！", "zh": "哇～谢谢您♪ 总觉得，充满了好多很有偶像风格的工作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1019_031tom", "source_sha256": "b6fa86a6d4e1eb67dc0f64f84d40136234fe6933882f72755bb899a201ac19fa", "ja": "サイン会に握手会ですか～。ふふ、子豚ちゃんたちと\n直接触れ合える、いい機会になりそうです～。", "zh": "签名会和握手会吗～。呵呵，这看来会是个能和小猪们直接接触的好机会呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "21b03fffe286c0c217c0c4ffa5d52a096644e012af5ab41886644c4d297b0ffb", "ja": "インストアライブ……。\n今度は……普通の、お客さんの前で……？", "zh": "店内现场演出……  \n这次是要在……普通客人面前……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "c713c89e3e306e63d710e0999df360344fc3cf736c129bb2dd202ebbb6c14843", "ja": "そうね、この前は記者さん達の前だったけど、\n今度はきっと……。", "zh": "是啊，上次是在记者们面前，\n这次一定会是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "0acf0beb58ba7ea234f4f639f575ab55f143202cf154885f8b6e975e2e2be71c", "ja": "ああ。来てくれるのは、早速ファンになってくれた人、\nただの通りすがりの人……いろいろだと思う。", "zh": "嗯。来的人，有马上成为粉丝的，也有只是路过的人……我想会有各种各样的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "02e17af7b2adc1ee2b7bd4741f63a6172f0be5c9a1f64f6b1d659be68237ab9f", "ja": "もちろん、簡単じゃないだろう。特にこのチームは\n初めてのことばっかりで、負担も大きいかもしれない。", "zh": "当然，这绝非易事。尤其是这支队伍\n全是第一次接触的事物，负担或许也很大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "b8e08aaa762f98c5a9ef192dcae75ed65b79c1b6b00619f5c2dbf5784c9d1a0e", "ja": "でも、このチームなら……\n必ず乗り越えてくれるって信じてる。", "zh": "但是，我相信这个团队的话……\n一定能克服困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "f0c9fc55be81d6053c50ffecc9d0d25209ccd01e515da913d05bf52b23021bce", "ja": "少なくとも、そう信じている人間が\nここにいるってことは、忘れないでほしい。", "zh": "至少，希望你们不要忘记，\n这里还有这样一个人，对你们坚信不疑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "b0d7727cda5a411a4437038189528f6f671b505ab04b9db8bfd72389ae1f61d5", "ja": "……、はいっ♪", "zh": "……好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "e8bbc398761c14e7157b4b1fe7ab06d896fbee16c2f6b622870b347dbe4f3be5", "ja": "……、はい～♪", "zh": "……，好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "dec06f1aa5c08afde0c6f63d1c60a55639b6e5ed023885cca5fdb7efe8d2d46c", "ja": "……、はい♪", "zh": "……，好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "6929229db120592b8153150e9a3dc5163b457271e5355da32c09ee7b07d07e1a", "ja": "……、はい。", "zh": "……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1030_null", "source_sha256": "b4ad0c80bd724114122f80e4110907f764551814a67610ecadf5dee94e5d4169", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ～！！", "zh": "啪啪啪啪～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "4a17ee9e85d20cb23d37f79cf0d6deca8755f03a9314be13667f3fb6b3c2125d", "ja": "そんな、拍手されるほどのことじゃ……。\nあれ？　誰もしてない？", "zh": "没、没到值得鼓掌的程度吧……  \n咦？没人鼓掌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1032_102mis", "source_sha256": "f301684ca722bb0eedda4b577995a20c7d0a9f9c29c01515e77f3fbe720cada4", "ja": "拍手は私たちでーす！", "zh": "拍手的是我们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "a681dcabbe80b2531b58b49de27787701117e25fbeeb02e0cd039bdc3bbfca85", "ja": "プロデューサーさん、かっこいい！\nよっ、すっかり一人前！", "zh": "制作人，好帅！\n哟，已经完全是个独当一面的人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "7ceb672fdf7653fdc788ce5ba2ec0170a3252c16e8d01712d235c6347185a7fa", "ja": "あ、青羽さん！？　それに音無さんまで！？", "zh": "啊，青羽小姐！？　还有音无小姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1035_president", "source_sha256": "535da63b20636600604a9ba61e6b0c2997a27b878d55dc274e63818fdb9c2d8d", "ja": "ウォッホン！　私もいるよ～？", "zh": "咳咳！我也在哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1036_401pro", "source_sha256": "9eb71c91c53fec150606ac36a5abb90867440441619731c96cd092147703d709", "ja": "あああっ、すみません社長！！\nどうしてか気づかなくて……！！", "zh": "啊啊啊，对不起，社长！！\n不知怎么的，竟然没注意到您……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1037_president", "source_sha256": "b1f0d724835f2958268d5f221e8bb3de48b10efd4ae6ea73f0eb083f11baeac5", "ja": "はっはっは、気にすることはない！\nこう見えて、私は目立たない男だからね！", "zh": "哈哈哈，不用在意！\n别看我这样，我可是个不起眼的男人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1038_102mis", "source_sha256": "0d86000302e5d5e37333ff3659937b5c0ce4c7c370fbb96fc3a744f3cac82c2b", "ja": "お二人とも、劇場の様子を見に来てくれたんです。\nそれで私がご案内中に、たまたま通りかかりまして♪", "zh": "两位是来看剧场情况的。然后在我带他们参观时，恰好路过了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1039_president", "source_sha256": "694614fd50bdaa9fdbea856bf1efb25736099ea1494ea2b30d63c1f8d8bb3af9", "ja": "そうそう、今のスピーチ、聞かせてもらったよ？\nアイドルを信じ、己の決断を信じて前に進む……。", "zh": "对了对了，我听到你刚才的演讲了哦？\n相信偶像，相信自己的决定，继续向前迈进……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1040_president", "source_sha256": "505f19b4aadcb56e5da51818a64f35aae3d65eccef576922725f4c81faa5a39b", "ja": "いや実にすばらしい！\nプロデューサーたるもの、そうでなくてはね！", "zh": "哎呀，真是太精彩了！\n身为制作人，就该是这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1041_101kot", "source_sha256": "a34f78b2f07ab177ad50ea96a64c92741bef7a4380465f4b78c40833b1b6336d", "ja": "きっとツアー中のチーフも、\n遠い空の下で喜んでますよ！", "zh": "巡演中的负责人，肯定也会在遥远的天空下为此感到高兴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1042_401pro", "source_sha256": "a5e2b37b0434e74477e4a4f0ac79920631df7d4634aebce391d05f1c17ea9453", "ja": "ど、どうですかね……。\n聞こえてないと思いますけど……。", "zh": "不、不知道呢……。\n我觉得应该听不见吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1043_president", "source_sha256": "80737b7d16b9557ee54e38ceecb19edd0d1c66d3c5ab7b235599a4edfd9005ce", "ja": "おっと、ミーティングの途中だったね、すまんすまん！\nささ、我々の事は気にせず、続けてくれたまえ。", "zh": "哎呀，原来会议还开到一半呢，抱歉抱歉！  \n来来，不用在意我们，请继续吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1044_401pro", "source_sha256": "259db8a91cdb736cd933ead50abab3172afdb9f86e85168e5cb9c69995ee833e", "ja": "は、はい……ええと……\nまあ、だいたい話は終わってて……。", "zh": "是、是的……那个……\n嗯，差不多已经说完了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1045_401pro", "source_sha256": "351699e71a6b000eb02f4ee4c66a3b6d958e2d0e290301fa9a692bb82721b880", "ja": "と、とにかく！　大変だと思うけど、\nしっかり支えるつもりだ。一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "总、总之！虽然我知道会很辛苦，但我打算好好支持你。我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1046_019min", "source_sha256": "305f2458a62991299c62f3269b25242602ab3c0a4b05f66340731ed351c4e224", "ja": "はいっ！\n頼りにしてますね、プロデューサーさん♪", "zh": "好的！\n我可就指望你了，制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1047_033sih", "source_sha256": "3fc5df17983dacf5c91d7f2e9ea3cfeb78f42fe85c5dc5c2c1be0c40e08d4986", "ja": "じゃあ、すぐにレッスンしないと。\nレッスンルーム予約してきます。", "zh": "那么，得马上开始练习才行。\n我去预约练习室。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "575636d1fd7e1568ccdc64e2350e0dc6df8a18af30510c36c4f1e16f551215db", "ja": "そういえば、ライブでは何曲歌うんですか？\n1曲だけではありませんよね～？", "zh": "说起来，演唱会要唱几首歌啊？\n不可能只唱1首吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1049_401pro", "source_sha256": "b997eef8dc377bd3275a160e681ed63e32596998aa5fd265d2efd35d52d8fc71", "ja": "もちろん。でもまだセトリが決まり切ってなくて……\nあ、いや、すぐ確定させて展開するよ！", "zh": "当然不止。不过歌单还没彻底定下来……\n啊，不，我马上就定好同步给大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1050_024ann", "source_sha256": "80cbf6b65baea3ddccee44245dfee55742ad0f5d6e23c8b197d38a9cd6424b30", "ja": "はっ……。\n握手会、ずっと、オンでいないと……！", "zh": "哈……。\n握手会，必须一直保持在线才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1051_102mis", "source_sha256": "0aea75b3b652323ed05b518ed4f69a0a3288cec377ee4f196372449fa788bfd1", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　衣装のデザインなんですけど、\n明日にはお出ししますね～！", "zh": "啊，对了对了！关于服装的设计，\n我明天就交给您哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1052_101kot", "source_sha256": "cb3deb92c9b14e58488008f91ab391aa8b1a04f2a1035db1cc36ea7cfb4cd4da", "ja": "……ふふっ♪", "zh": "……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1053_101kot", "source_sha256": "090417b55d68cc4031a1fd54fbb7737bec45c291577788f673af1c67870552c3", "ja": "やっぱり劇場のみんなは、社長の思っていた通り……\nでしたね♪", "zh": "剧场的大家果然正如社长所想的那样……\n呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0302_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0302_story_intro_1054_president", "source_sha256": "234beb209cc41869cc5ab7576423b2decb239cb659e0b3beabfe789719837b0e", "ja": "そうだろう？　輝く未来への扉を開き、思い思いの希望\nを胸に、賑やかに進んでいく……。うむ、結構結構！", "zh": "是吧？打开通往璀璨未来的大门，怀抱各自的希望，热热闹闹地向前迈进……嗯，不错不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
